a:4:{s:7:"mf-text";s:27:"Question about your website";s:8:"mf-email";s:29:"harvey.websolution6@gmail.com";s:12:"mf-telephone";s:10:"8456404550";s:7:"Message";s:339:"Hi,
I noticed your website is facing SEO (Search Engine Optimization) issues, making it harder to find on search engines like Google, Bing, and Yahoo. We're here to help! Please provide your phone number and a convenient time for a call, and let's work together to get this resolved as soon as possible.
Best Regards, Harvey Miller";}

a:4:{s:7:"mf-text";s:22:"Help with Dropshipping";s:8:"mf-email";s:19:"felix-maedel@gmx.de";s:12:"mf-telephone";s:11:"01776918166";s:7:"Message";s:798:"Hello DutchDigits,

some guy I know told me I should use an agency for getting started in dropshipping and he recommended dutchdigits. Now I m confused a little and he told me to tell you about my concerns. The thing I dont get is 1253 clients who gave feedback according to the website, but still relativly low traffic on the social media accounts with just 5+ -  videos on tiktok, 40+ - maybe on instagram which barely have likes and not much followers. Another website told me that dutchdigits doesnt have a high reputation or is anywhere near being very popular, even though you had 1253 happy clients as said before. Sounds a bit weird ( not to hate or something, I m just a very very very careful person ). Hope you can help answer my questions. Sorry for the lots of text. 

Best regards";}
